OL,3,GNEWSAWorker dies after incident at     
OL,4,Ashopping centre                        
OL,6,FA man in his 40s has died after an     
OL,7,Fincident at Brent Cross Shopping Centre
OL,8,Fin north-west London.                  
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the  
OL,11,Fcentre in Prince Charles Drive, Hendon,
OL,12,Fshortly after 05:00 GMT on Wednesday.  
OL,14,FThe man, who had been carrying out work
OL,15,Fat the shopping centre, was taken to   
OL,16,Fhospital but died the following day,   
OL,17,Fthe Metropolitan Police said.          
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
