OL,3,GNEWSAWorker dies after incident at     
OL,4,Ashopping centre                        
OL,6,FThe shopping centre closed for the day 
OL,7,Ffollowing the incident. An             
OL,8,Finvestigation into the circumstances of
OL,9,Fhis death is under way and The Health  
OL,10,Fand Safety Executive has been informed.
